{"resourceIdentifier":"2355","resourceName":"Suzhou Qizishan MSW landfill site redundant LFG recovery to power project","description":"Suzhou Qizishan MSW landfill site redundant LFG recovery to power project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Qizishan MSW landfill site(hereafter referred to as the Qizishan landfill site)， in Suzhou City, Jiangsu Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Suzhou Baichang Renewable Energy Co.,Ltd.(hereafter referred to as the project owner)\r\nQizishan landfill site started collecting and handling waste in 1993 and was closed in 2009. Expansion project of Qizishan landfill site started in 2006.  Currently, about 3200 tons MSW are dumped to the Qizishan landfill site everyday. There are 3 sets (3*1.75MW) gas engines installed on site to capture and utilize the LFG before implementation of the project,which is managed by (Suzhou) biogas Recovery to Power Co.Ltd. of Guangda Environmental Energy (hereafter referred to as Guangda).Considering that Guangda  couldn’t completely destroy the LFG generated by Qizishan landfill site,Suzhou Municipal Authority  demand Guangda should add the landfill gas collection and disposal device by making an additional investment or introducing the third party. Under the circumstances, Guangda newly installed 8 sets(8*0.745MW) gas engine which have been commercially operated, and the project owner as the third professional party will install 8 sets(8*0.745MW) gas engine to capture the redundant LFG of the Qizishan landfill site. \r\nThe project started to construct on 01/09/2020.The project has a total designed capacity 5.96MW(8*0.745MW) and combusts the redundant LFG of Qizishan landfill site, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Eastern China Power Grid (ECPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 99,458 MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 46,609 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":31.237700,"longitude":120.553600},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-04-10","endExclusive":"2021-05-11","endInclusive":"2021-05-10"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2355"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Suzhou Baichang Renewable Energy Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2355"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"40317"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"25/08/2021"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/12/2020 - 30/11/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=48709&IDKEY=ulksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098s67169711","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Suzhou-20200921.docx","uploadDate":"2020-09-23T01:21:41.81Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=50813&IDKEY=9kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj90970071127","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Descrip